,"detail":"當期 ROA = 1.6%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $918M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 73.3%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.50"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":28.74,"default_fair_val":28.74,"premium_pct":58,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":79.7,"pe_forward":70.1,"pb_trailing":14.1,"pb_forward":12.7,"div_yield":7.64,"ps_ratio":4.7,"fcf_to_ev":7.02,"fcf_to_mcap":5.27,"liab_to_assets":73.3,"cash_to_assets":6.7,"current_ratio":1.5,"roe":17.7,"roa":1.6,"moat":{"ticker":"TPG","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"TPG 作為一家領先的另類資產管理公司，其品牌價值在吸引高淨值客戶和機構投資者方面扮演著關鍵角色。其在私募股權、房地產和信貸等領域的專業聲譽，使其能夠收取相對較高的管理費和績效費，這體現了一定的定價權。然而，與消費品牌不同，其品牌影響力更多體現在專業領域的信任度，而非廣泛的消費者認知，因此定價權的強度相對有限，但仍構成穩固的護城河。","comment_en":"TPG's brand as a leading alternative asset manager is crucial for attracting high-net-worth individuals and institutional investors. Its reputation in private equity, real estate, and credit allows it to command relatively high management and performance fees, indicating some pricing power. However, unlike consumer brands, its brand influence is more about professional trust than broad consumer recognition, making its pricing power less absolute but still a solid moat."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"資產管理行業的進入壁壘主要來自監管牌照和合規要求，而非技術專利。TPG 擁有必要的監管許可和豐富的運營經驗，這構成了其運營的基礎。然而，這些監管要求對所有行業參與者都是共通的，並非 TPG 獨有的專利壁壘。雖然合規性是必要的，但它更多地是維持競爭資格的門檻，而非創造顯著的差異化優勢或排他性。","comment_en":"The asset management industry's barriers to entry stem primarily from regulatory licenses and compliance, not technical patents. TPG possesses the necessary regulatory approvals and extensive operational experience, forming the foundation of its business. However, these regulatory requirements are common to all industry participants and do not represent a unique patent-like barrier for TPG. While compliance is essential, it acts more as a qualification threshold than a significant differentiator or exclusive advantage."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"對於機構投資者而言，更換資產管理公司涉及複雜的盡職調查、法律文件和投資組合重組，這些過程耗時且成本高昂。TPG 的長期客戶關係和其管理的複雜基金結構，增加了客戶轉換的難度。一旦客戶將資金委託給 TPG，並對其表現和服務感到滿意，出於對潛在波動和交易成本的考量，他們通常會維持較長的合作關係，這構成了顯著的轉換成本壁壘。","comment_en":"For institutional investors, switching asset managers involves extensive due diligence, legal documentation, and portfolio restructuring, all of which are time-consuming and costly. TPG's long-standing client relationships and the complexity of its managed fund structures increase the difficulty of client transitions. Once clients entrust their capital to TPG and are satisfied with its performance and service, they tend to maintain long-term partnerships due to concerns about potential volatility and transaction costs, creating a significant switching cost barrier."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"TPG 的網絡效應體現在其平台效應和信息優勢。隨著公司規模的擴大和投資業績的提升，其吸引更多優質交易機會和頂尖人才的能力也隨之增強。更多的投資者和交易夥伴的參與，可以為 TPG 帶來更廣泛的市場洞察和潛在的協同效應，進一步鞏固其市場地位。這種正反饋循環雖然不如社交網絡明顯，但在金融服務領域是真實存在的。","comment_en":"TPG's network effects are evident in its platform and information advantages. As the firm grows in scale and investment performance improves, its ability to attract more high-quality deal flow and top talent is enhanced. The participation of more investors and deal partners can provide TPG with broader market insights and potential synergies, further solidifying its market position. While not as pronounced as in social networks, this positive feedback loop is real in the financial services sector."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"作為一家大型資產管理公司，TPG 受益於顯著的規模經濟效應。其龐大的資產管理規模（AUM）使其能夠攤薄固定運營成本（如技術、合規、研究）於更大的基礎上，從而降低單位管理成本。這使得 TPG 相較於小型競爭者，在運營效率和成本控制方面具有優勢，能夠提供更具競爭力的費用結構，並有能力投入更多資源於研究和人才培養。","comment_en":"As a large asset management firm, TPG benefits from significant economies of scale. Its substantial Assets Under Management (AUM) allow it to spread fixed operating costs (technology, compliance, research) over a larger base, reducing per-unit management costs. This gives TPG an advantage in operational efficiency and cost control compared to smaller competitors, enabling it to offer more competitive fee structures and invest more resources in research and talent development."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"TPG 在全球範圍內開展業務，並在特定地區和資產類別（如亞洲私募股權、房地產）建立了專業知識和網絡。這種地理上的佈局和對特定市場的深入理解，構成了其獨特的競爭優勢。然而，金融服務業的全球化程度較高，許多競爭對手也擁有相似的國際佈局，因此其地理優勢的獨特性和排他性相對有限，更多體現在其特定市場的深耕能力。","comment_en":"TPG operates globally and has established expertise and networks in specific regions and asset classes, such as Asian private equity and real estate. This geographical presence and deep understanding of particular markets constitute its unique competitive advantage. However, the financial services industry is highly globalized, and many competitors also have similar international footprints, making the uniqueness and exclusivity of its geographical advantage relatively limited. It is more reflected in its ability to deeply cultivate specific markets."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"TPG 在運營效率方面表現出色，這得益於其對技術的投資、標準化的流程以及經驗豐富的管理團隊。其較高的 ROE (17.7%) 和 ROA (1.6%)，以及穩健的自由現金流（FCF TTM: $917.5M），都證明了其卓越的盈利能力和資源利用效率。相較於行業平均水平，TPG 能夠更有效地管理成本並產生高額利潤，這構成了一個堅實的護城河。","comment_en":"TPG demonstrates strong operational efficiency, driven by its investments in technology, standardized processes, and an experienced management team. Its solid ROE (17.7%) and ROA (1.6%), along with robust Free Cash Flow (FCF TTM: $917.5M), attest to its excellent profitability and resource utilization. Compared to industry averages, TPG effectively manages costs and generates substantial profits, forming a solid moat."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"TPG 的管理層在資本配置方面展現了卓越的能力。公司歷史上多次成功地將資本投入到高增長領域，並通過精準的併購和剝離策略，優化了資產組合。其穩健的財務狀況（現金 $944.7M / 負債 $2,988.6M）和持續產生自由現金流的能力，為其提供了靈活的資本配置選項。有效的資本配置是長期價值創造的關鍵，也是 TPG 堅實護城河的重要組成部分。","comment_en":"TPG's management exhibits exceptional capital allocation skills. The company has a history of successfully deploying capital into high-growth areas and optimizing its asset portfolio through astute M&A and divestiture strategies. Its sound financial position (Cash $944.7M / Debt $2,988.6M) and consistent free cash flow generation provide flexibility in capital deployment. Effective capital allocation is key to long-term value creation and forms a significant part of TPG's robust moat."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"TPG 在客戶保留方面表現良好，這主要歸功於其卓越的投資業績、穩定的客戶關係管理以及提供的差異化服務。一旦客戶與 TPG 建立起信任關係並獲得滿意的回報，他們傾向於長期合作。公司專注於建立和維護與機構投資者和高淨值客戶的長期夥伴關係，通過持續的溝通和價值交付來鞏固客戶忠誠度，這構成了穩固的護城河。","comment_en":"TPG demonstrates strong customer retention, primarily due to its excellent investment performance, stable client relationship management, and differentiated services. Once clients establish trust and achieve satisfactory returns with TPG, they tend to engage in long-term collaborations. The firm focuses on building and maintaining long-term partnerships with institutional investors and high-net-worth clients, reinforcing loyalty through continuous communication and value delivery, which constitutes a solid moat."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"TPG 的業務模式具有較強的韌性，能夠在不同市場週期中保持穩健。其多元化的資產類別和地理區域分散了風險。儘管金融服務業易受宏觀經濟波動影響，但 TPG 的另類投資專長使其能夠在波動市場中尋找機會。其穩定的管理團隊和對長期價值的專注，也增強了業務的持久性。這種抗波動能力和長期導向使其護城河相對堅固。","comment_en":"TPG's business model exhibits considerable resilience, enabling it to remain robust through various market cycles. Its diversified asset classes and geographic regions mitigate risks. Although the financial services industry is susceptible to macroeconomic fluctuations, TPG's expertise in alternative investments allows it to identify opportunities in volatile markets. Its stable management team and focus on long-term value also enhance business durability. This resilience and long-term orientation contribute to a relatively strong moat."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"TPG 作為一家領先的另類資產管理公司，展現了多方面的競爭優勢。其品牌聲譽和客戶關係構成了顯著的轉換成本壁壘，使得客戶黏性較高。規模經濟效應和卓越的運營效率，使其在成本控制和盈利能力上優於許多競爭對手。管理層出色的資本配置能力，持續為股東創造價值。雖然缺乏專利壁壘，但其在特定市場的專業知識和全球佈局，以及穩健的業務韌性，共同構成了類似於「收費橋」的商業模式，能夠在經濟週期中穩定地產生費用收入，體現了堅固的經濟護城河。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"TPG, a leading alternative asset manager, demonstrates multiple competitive advantages. Its brand reputation and client relationships create significant switching costs, fostering high customer stickiness. Economies of scale and operational efficiency provide advantages in cost control and profitability over many competitors. The management's excellent capital allocation consistently creates shareholder value. While lacking patent barriers, its specialized market knowledge, global presence, and business resilience collectively form a 'toll bridge' like business model, stably generating fee income through economic cycles, reflecting a solid economic moat.","evidenceHash":"2837546e53fc262b14265307a52c6ce16b66bf0d5d3a3ec417349837e4b10e3d","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"940879b3cec87f42f10fa6e5c88a3cf18c9345f5818206d5d5384367718756ba"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"940879b3cec87f42f10fa6e5c88a3cf18c9345f5818206d5d5384367718756ba"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TPG.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TPG.png","website":"https://www.tpg.com","ceo":"Jon Winkelried","full_time_employees":"1900","description":"TPG Inc. operates globally as a specialized manager of alternative investments. The firm delivers a suite of services, including investment management for diverse pooled vehicles such as unconsolidated funds and collateralized loan obligations. Additionally, TPG provides comprehensive oversight and strategic advisory services to its portfolio companies, encompassing capital structuring, facilitating debt and equity arrangements, and general consultation. It also assists with underwriting and placing securities. TPG allocates capital across various asset classes, with significant investments in private equity funds, real estate funds, credit funds, and funds of hedge funds. Established in 1992, TPG Inc. maintains its headquarters in Fort Worth, Texas, and functions as a subsidiary of TPG GP A, LLC.","description_en":"TPG Inc. operates globally as a specialized manager of alternative investments. The firm delivers a suite of services, including investment management for diverse pooled vehicles such as unconsolidated funds and collateralized loan obligations. Additionally, TPG provides comprehensive oversight and strategic advisory services to its portfolio companies, encompassing capital structuring, facilitating debt and equity arrangements, and general consultation. It also assists with underwriting and placing securities. TPG allocates capital across various asset classes, with significant investments in private equity funds, real estate funds, credit funds, and funds of hedge funds. Established in 1992, TPG Inc. maintains its headquarters in Fort Worth, Texas, and functions as a subsidiary of TPG GP A, LLC.","description_zh":"**TPG Inc. (TPG) 業務營運概述**\n\nTPG Inc. 是一家全球性的另類投資管理公司，專注於提供多元化的投資管理服務。其核心業務涵蓋為各種集合投資工具（如未合併基金及擔保貸款義務）進行投資管理。此外，TPG 也為其投資組合公司提供全面的營運監督與策略諮詢服務，包括資本結構規劃、債務與股權安排協調，以及一般性顧問服務。公司亦協助進行證券的承銷與配置。\n\nTPG 的資本配置策略涵蓋多種資產類別，主要投資於私募股權基金、不動產基金、信用基金及對沖基金的基金。該公司成立於 1992 年，總部位於德州沃斯堡，為 TPG GP A, LLC 的子公司。TPG 以其專業的另類投資管理能力，在全球市場中扮演重要角色。","address":"301 Commerce Street, Suite 3300","city":"Fort Worth","state":"TX","zip":"76102","country":"US","phone":"817 871 4000","full_address":"301 Commerce Street, Suite 3300, Fort Worth, TX 76102, US","range_52w":"36.95-70.38","year_high":70.38,"year_low":36.95,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":36.95,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-08-19","name":"Andre Axel","title":"officer: Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":164908,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-19","name":"Andre Axel","title":"officer: Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":164908,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-07","name":"WINKELRIED JON","title":"director, 10 percent owner, officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":1152,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-07","name":"WINKELRIED JON","title":"director, 10 percent owner, officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":357,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-07","name":"WINKELRIED JON","title":"director, 10 percent owner, officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":179,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-07","name":"Vazquez-Ubarri Anilu","title":"director, officer: Chief Operating Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":155,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-07","name":"Trujillo David","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":630,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-07